    <briefdescription>
<para>Custom deleter for <ref refid="classcslt_1_1String" kindref="compound">String</ref> instances. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements proper cleanup for <ref refid="classcslt_1_1String" kindref="compound">String</ref> objects by:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Freeing the internal character buffer</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Freeing the <ref refid="classcslt_1_1String" kindref="compound">String</ref> object itself Both operations use the allocator stored in the <ref refid="classcslt_1_1String" kindref="compound">String</ref>.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>This deleter is used with <ref refid="classcslt_1_1UniquePtr" kindref="compound">UniquePtr</ref> to provide RAII semantics.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classcslt_1_1HeapAllocator" kindref="compound">cslt::HeapAllocator</ref><sp/>allocator;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>r<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classcslt_1_1String_1ab1efd0bf9fe05c2af789e5fb74f7223c" kindref="member">cslt::String::init</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;example&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>0,<sp/>allocator);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(r.hasValue())<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>String<sp/>is<sp/>automatically<sp/>cleaned<sp/>up<sp/>when<sp/>UniquePtr<sp/>goes<sp/>out<sp/>of<sp/>scope</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classcslt_1_1UniquePtr" kindref="compound">cslt::UniquePtr&lt;cslt::String, cslt::StringDeleter&gt;</ref><sp/>str(r.value());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>str-&gt;c_str()<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>std::endl;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Deleter<sp/>called<sp/>here</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
